{"logId": "9346fd9e-ac84-4ea5-b8db-0bb078ac9402", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [170, 141, 559, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[170.0, 141.0], [559.0, 141.0], [559.0, 172.0], [170.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：不依附父母，与父母保持良好的沟通、理解和关爱，量力而行地照顾父母生活，整体和睦融洽。（传统）", "block_bbox": [163, 216, 1002, 271], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 216.0], [1002.0, 216.0], [1002.0, 271.0], [163.0, 271.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母与子女两代人如果生活在一起，难免会有代沟，包括思想观念、生活方式、消费观等，偶尔有摩擦和争吵，但能够积极地化解矛盾，不形成怨恨，能改变的改变、实在不能改变就选择理解和接受，不造成精神伤害。整体来说，相互体谅和包容，也做到对父母的关心和生活上的照顾及安排。", "block_bbox": [163, 308, 1005, 394], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 308.0], [1005.0, 308.0], [1005.0, 394.0], [163.0, 394.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [166, 437, 283, 460], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 437.0], [282.0, 437.0], [282.0, 459.0], [166.0, 459.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、定期安排父母做全面体检（每年一次）", "block_bbox": [182, 477, 510, 499], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 477.0], [510.0, 477.0], [510.0, 499.0], [182.0, 499.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、相处中做到良好的倾听，能够对父母保持基本的体谅、理解和包容", "block_bbox": [183, 507, 735, 530], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 507.0], [735.0, 507.0], [735.0, 530.0], [183.0, 530.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、双方彼此尊重对方父母，不因区别对待造成矛盾", "block_bbox": [183, 538, 593, 560], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 538.0], [593.0, 538.0], [593.0, 560.0], [183.0, 560.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、尊重父母的生活习惯，不因差异造成矛盾", "block_bbox": [181, 569, 540, 590], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[187.0, 569.0], [539.0, 569.0], [539.0, 589.0], [187.0, 589.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、合理地安排父母旅行，引导他们享受生活", "block_bbox": [182, 600, 539, 622], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 600.0], [539.0, 600.0], [539.0, 622.0], [182.0, 622.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、根据父母身体情况，在父母家中配备适用的必要药品和设施，让父母在发生紧急情况时能够自救", "block_bbox": [181, 631, 969, 653], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[187.0, 631.0], [968.0, 631.0], [968.0, 652.0], [187.0, 652.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[56]", "block_bbox": [574, 717, 611, 738], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [574.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [207, 901, 595, 932], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[207.0, 901.0], [595.0, 901.0], [595.0, 932.0], [207.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 976, 337, 998], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 976.0], [336.0, 976.0], [336.0, 997.0], [202.0, 997.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、对父母说话没耐心，经常用不耐烦的语气交流", "block_bbox": [217, 1016, 612, 1039], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[223.0, 1016.0], [610.9999389648438, 1016.0], [610.9999389648438, 1038.0], [223.0, 1038.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、因为父母文化水平低或长期在农村、穿着朴素等，在人前感觉不自信或刻意规避", "block_bbox": [217, 1047, 879, 1070], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 1047.0], [879.0, 1047.0], [879.0, 1070.0], [217.0, 1070.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[57]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 15, "block_order": null, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.830826461315155, "coordinate": [170, 141, 559, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[170.0, 141.0], [559.0, 141.0], [559.0, 172.0], [170.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6012903451919556, "coordinate": [163, 216, 1002, 271], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 216.0], [1002.0, 216.0], [1002.0, 271.0], [163.0, 271.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9279170632362366, "coordinate": [163, 308, 1005, 394], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 308.0], [1005.0, 308.0], [1005.0, 394.0], [163.0, 394.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6204231977462769, "coordinate": [166, 437, 283, 460], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 437.0], [282.0, 437.0], [282.0, 459.0], [166.0, 459.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7836166620254517, "coordinate": [182, 477, 510, 499], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 477.0], [510.0, 477.0], [510.0, 499.0], [182.0, 499.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8060857653617859, "coordinate": [183, 507, 735, 530], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 507.0], [735.0, 507.0], [735.0, 530.0], [183.0, 530.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.795041024684906, "coordinate": [183, 538, 593, 560], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 538.0], [593.0, 538.0], [593.0, 560.0], [183.0, 560.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7925335168838501, "coordinate": [181, 569, 540, 590], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[187.0, 569.0], [539.0, 569.0], [539.0, 589.0], [187.0, 589.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8134540319442749, "coordinate": [182, 600, 539, 622], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[182.0, 600.0], [539.0, 600.0], [539.0, 622.0], [182.0, 622.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8146355748176575, "coordinate": [181, 631, 969, 653], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[187.0, 631.0], [968.0, 631.0], [968.0, 652.0], [187.0, 652.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6848164796829224, "coordinate": [574, 717, 611, 738], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[574.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [574.0, 737.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8521376252174377, "coordinate": [207, 901, 595, 932], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[207.0, 901.0], [595.0, 901.0], [595.0, 932.0], [207.0, 932.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6965346932411194, "coordinate": [202, 976, 337, 998], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 976.0], [336.0, 976.0], [336.0, 997.0], [202.0, 997.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8105382919311523, "coordinate": [217, 1016, 612, 1039], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[223.0, 1016.0], [610.9999389648438, 1016.0], [610.9999389648438, 1038.0], [223.0, 1038.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8237428069114685, "coordinate": [217, 1047, 879, 1070], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[217.0, 1047.0], [879.0, 1047.0], [879.0, 1070.0], [217.0, 1070.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.642975926399231, "coordinate": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n## 二 级【1~2分】：不依附父母，与父母保持良好的沟通、理解和关爱，量力而行地照顾父母生活，整体和睦融洽。（传统）\n\n- 本条释义：父母与子女两代人如果生活在一起，难免会有代沟，包括思想观念、生活方式、消费观等，偶尔有摩擦和争吵，但能够积极地化解矛盾，不形成怨恨，能改变的改变、实在不能改变就选择理解和接受，不造成精神伤害。整体来说，相互体谅和包容，也做到对父母的关心和生活上的照顾及安排。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、定期安排父母做全面体检（每年一次）\n\n2、相处中做到良好的倾听，能够对父母保持基本的体谅、理解和包容\n\n3、双方彼此尊重对方父母，不因区别对待造成矛盾\n\n4、尊重父母的生活习惯，不因差异造成矛盾\n\n5、合理地安排父母旅行，引导他们享受生活\n\n6、根据父母身体情况，在父母家中配备适用的必要药品和设施，让父母在发生紧急情况时能够自救\n\n[56]\n\n## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n## - 不符合的行为：\n\n1、对父母说话没耐心，经常用不耐烦的语气交流\n\n2、因为父母文化水平低或长期在农村、穿着朴素等，在人前感觉不自信或刻意规避", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9346fd9e-ac84-4ea5-b8db-0bb078ac9402/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffa0de3890aa4eab526f9b80b4a57af5e28919f59fb777f15d5beef933c389ab9"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9346fd9e-ac84-4ea5-b8db-0bb078ac9402/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F5a348bbafe30a1e5ba35fe13c41c075df6288edecda51a679d37121b983f1b27"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9346fd9e-ac84-4ea5-b8db-0bb078ac9402/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe8714c8cc9330106c0a672c8952a1bc9dd79ede029982a0f3e378ac3fb46fbb5"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
